      "Gift From Father",
      "",
      "One day, Little Bao and his father passed by a toy store. Little Bao stood by the door and didn't want to leave.",
      "",
      "Father: What’s wrong? Do you want to buy a toy?",
      "",
      "Little Bao: Yes dad, I want to buy a new toy.",
      "",
      "Father: Didn’t we agree on this? We will not buy a new toy until your current toy is broken.",
      "",
      "Little Bao: But the big iron ball you bought me will never break."
    ]
